.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
~$*

# Raw pipeline output, staged here to be imported into the gallery by
# tools/add_gallery_samples.py. Hundreds of megabytes of frames, per-line
# narration audio and source renders - the gallery keeps only what it needs
# (assets/gallery/), and the rest has no business in a published site.
assets/GALLERY_ADDED/

# Source diagrams for examples not (yet) in the gallery, kept as optimized
# copies when the staging folders were cleared out. Nothing on the site reads
# them; they are here so the material is not lost with the folders.
source_diagrams/

# The pipeline's raw animation exports, staged here and wrapped into the
# self-contained files under assets/gallery/exports/ by
# tools/build_svg_exports.py. The wrappers are what the site serves.
assets/EXPORTS/
